{"4429430":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Origins Trading Card Game","steam_appid":4429430,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Origins TCG is a fast-paced competitive card game with limited edition cards. Outsmart opponents, collect iconic characters like Mulan &amp; Robin Hood, and trade to build the ultimate collection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is both players' turn. Outplay your rivals in ~7 minutes. Battle in 3 lanes with unique conditions so no two games feel the same.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip packs. Trade dupes. Collect digital graded cards. Every pack is full of limited edition legends with marketplace value.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8c6ecebe2a2a8d031c68cf18c2e901e6.poster.avif?t=1793314125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8c6ecebe2a2a8d031c68cf18c2e901e6.webm?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8c6ecebe2a2a8d031c68cf18c2e901e6.mp4?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>The best competitive games start with a level playing field.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s why every Origins player can earn all the cards they need to build competitive decks, for free. Spending money will never unlock stronger cards or give you an advantage in gameplay. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/4aee00a5e5a5bc3325207d25020ab6f5.poster.avif?t=1793314125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/4aee00a5e5a5bc3325207d25020ab6f5.webm?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/4aee00a5e5a5bc3325207d25020ab6f5.mp4?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Collect rare, hand-drawn cosmetic variants of your favorite cards, then trade them with other players in the marketplace. Rip limited-edition collectibles, chase legendary pulls, and discover grail cards prized for their artistry and rarity, not their gameplay power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/0c1baa5b6d6af4a576061e773bbe708c.poster.avif?t=1793314125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/0c1baa5b6d6af4a576061e773bbe708c.webm?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/0c1baa5b6d6af4a576061e773bbe708c.mp4?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Both players move at once. Simultaneous turns means no more waiting for your opponent to take their turn. Draw, predict, and battle across three dynamic locations. Outplay your opponent in ~7 minutes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br>   <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/deb05eee0f05784ccd462b6ed82b8512.poster.avif?t=1793314125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/deb05eee0f05784ccd462b6ed82b8512.webm?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/deb05eee0f05784ccd462b6ed82b8512.mp4?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Every match draws from a pool of 100+ rotating locations that reshape the board and demand a unique strategy. Easy to learn, difficult to master. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8085005ff670a1dbdf751a570955034b.poster.avif?t=1793314125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8085005ff670a1dbdf751a570955034b.webm?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8085005ff670a1dbdf751a570955034b.mp4?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Origins is an original world inspired by history's most iconic characters like Robin Hood, Queen of Hearts, &amp; Winnie-the-Pooh. Earth got their names right and everything else wrong. Now the portals are open, and only the worthy may enter.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Origins TCG is a fast-paced competitive card game with limited edition cards. Outsmart opponents, collect iconic characters like Mulan &amp; Robin Hood, and trade to build the ultimate collection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is both players' turn. Outplay your rivals in ~7 minutes. Battle in 3 lanes with unique conditions so no two games feel the same.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip packs. Trade dupes. Collect digital graded cards. Every pack is full of limited edition legends with marketplace value.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8c6ecebe2a2a8d031c68cf18c2e901e6.poster.avif?t=1793314125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8c6ecebe2a2a8d031c68cf18c2e901e6.webm?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8c6ecebe2a2a8d031c68cf18c2e901e6.mp4?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>The best competitive games start with a level playing field.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s why every Origins player can earn all the cards they need to build competitive decks, for free. Spending money will never unlock stronger cards or give you an advantage in gameplay. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/4aee00a5e5a5bc3325207d25020ab6f5.poster.avif?t=1793314125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/4aee00a5e5a5bc3325207d25020ab6f5.webm?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/4aee00a5e5a5bc3325207d25020ab6f5.mp4?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Collect rare, hand-drawn cosmetic variants of your favorite cards, then trade them with other players in the marketplace. Rip limited-edition collectibles, chase legendary pulls, and discover grail cards prized for their artistry and rarity, not their gameplay power.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/0c1baa5b6d6af4a576061e773bbe708c.poster.avif?t=1793314125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/0c1baa5b6d6af4a576061e773bbe708c.webm?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/0c1baa5b6d6af4a576061e773bbe708c.mp4?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Both players move at once. Simultaneous turns means no more waiting for your opponent to take their turn. Draw, predict, and battle across three dynamic locations. Outplay your opponent in ~7 minutes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br>   <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/deb05eee0f05784ccd462b6ed82b8512.poster.avif?t=1793314125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/deb05eee0f05784ccd462b6ed82b8512.webm?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/deb05eee0f05784ccd462b6ed82b8512.mp4?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Every match draws from a pool of 100+ rotating locations that reshape the board and demand a unique strategy. Easy to learn, difficult to master. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8085005ff670a1dbdf751a570955034b.poster.avif?t=1793314125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8085005ff670a1dbdf751a570955034b.webm?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/extras\/8085005ff670a1dbdf751a570955034b.mp4?t=1793314125\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Origins is an original world inspired by history's most iconic characters like Robin Hood, Queen of Hearts, &amp; Winnie-the-Pooh. Earth got their names right and everything else wrong. Now the portals are open, and only the worthy may enter.<\/p>","short_description":"Outplay rivals in a fast PvP card game where both players move at once. Adapt your strategy and battle for three of 100+ rotating locations. Build decks with reimagined legends like Robin Hood and Mulan. Every competitive card is free. Rip packs for rare, limited-edition variants to trade on Steam.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/bf6af505939c39d6d4539c8fc6b0cdb061b1f623\/header.jpg?t=1793314125","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/b31884089fdd18b410bee7f45f93501ae85898be\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793314125","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/b31884089fdd18b410bee7f45f93501ae85898be\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793314125","website":"https:\/\/origins-tcg.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD FX-6300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ AMD Radeon R9 270X<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible sound card<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 \/ AMD Radeon RX 580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible sound card<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 10.14 Mojave<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 (dual-core, 2.5 GHz)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal-capable GPU (Intel Iris \/ Apple M1 integrated graphics supported)<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Built-in or compatible audio<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 Monterey or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 Pro or Intel Core i7 (quad-core, 2.6 GHz)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M2 GPU \/ AMD Radeon Pro 5500M<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Built-in or compatible audio<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Koin Games"],"publishers":["Koin Games"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":27,"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/a125abe05ccf9462db826697564b6193f711a02b\/ss_a125abe05ccf9462db826697564b6193f711a02b.600x338.jpg?t=1793314125","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/a125abe05ccf9462db826697564b6193f711a02b\/ss_a125abe05ccf9462db826697564b6193f711a02b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793314125"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4429430\/8137f2cbde038251079b9e1e5811ad249eec218d\/ss_8137f2cbde038251079b9e1e5811ad249eec218d.600x338.jpg?t=1793314125","path_fu